  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You become in tune with earth and stone, hardening your skin, and extending your senses through the ground.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, your <strong>Armor</strong> increases by +<strong>1</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, you can sense the position of any creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong> of yourself, so long as they are on the ground or objects in contact with the ground.</p><p>You ignore the effects of <strong>Difficult Terrain</strong>, and you cannot be <strong>Shoved</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can increase your <strong>Armor</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.eX0S046K8GK4EUc3]{Earth Attunement}</p>",
